    Revert org.apache.santuario upgrade (#6528)
    
    This reverts commit 77fab3349f36d71aa9aa9ea9b0614849b9bcb1b3, which
    upgraded org.apache.santuario. The issue with this is that CAS will not
    start with the upgraded version since it requires
    `jakarta.xml.bind>=4.0.0` and that conflicts with... well, most of our
    other dependencies.
    
    Fixes #6477.
    
